    "//ExorcismSmudge": "Feature 26's Exorcism row (plan section 26), the cure for spirit sickness (plan section 28). A CT0 consumable made by hw_bp_exorcism_smudge from VANILLA cards only (bog myrtle through the tab group GpTag_Myrtle, dried juniper needles). DismantleAction 'Burn the Smudge': a rite at a lit fire, so it needs a card carrying the vanilla tag tag_Fire on the board (RequiredTagsOnBoard; lit campfires, fire pits, fireplaces and hearths carry it, unlit ones do not: CSFF_Patterns.md 'Lit'), and it is offered only while hw_spiritsickness is 1 to 288 (RequiredStatValues, HideAllWhenNotMet). DaytimeCost 2, hw_spiritsickness -96 (one stage), the card is used up (ReceivingCardChanges ModType 3). No switch: it is a cure the player makes on purpose. Prompt 41's dancing plague reuses this card with a second DismantleAction, 'Burn the Smudge to Break the Dance' (hw_dancingplague, -32 the whole stat, the same tag_Fire and own-stat gates). Art: PARTIAL, the vanilla sprite BogMyrtle_Dry stands in until a picture is made. Every number is a TUNABLE PLACEHOLDER.",
